, stock brokerage, and tax preparation services; and Afterpay, a buy now, pay later platform. In addition, the company operates TIDAL, a platform for musicians and fans; TBD, an open developer platform focused on making the decentralized financial world accessible; Bitkey, a self-custody bitcoin wallet; and proto. The company was formerly known as Square, Inc. and changed its name to Block, Inc. in Decembe","web":"https://www.block.xyz","empleados":10205.0,"pyg":{"y":["2022","2023","2024","2025"],"ingresos":[17531600000.0,21915600000.0,24121100000.0,24193700000.0],"ebitda":[313245000.0,790384000.0,2062680000.0,3415180000.0],"ebit":[-27278000.0,381824000.0,1686550000.0,3045650000.0],"beneficio":[-540747000.0,9772000.0,2897050000.0,1305640000.0],"bpa":[-0.93,0.02,4.56,2.1]},"caja":{"y":["2022","2023","2024","2025"],"fcf":[5088000.0,-50190000.0,1553400000.0,2424680000.0],"fco":[175903000.0,100961000.0,1707350000.0,2579710000.0],"capex":[-170815000.0,-151151000.0,-153947000.0,-155038000.0]},"balance":{"y":["2022","2023","2024","2025"],"deuda":[6332760000.0,6071520000.0,7918610000.0,8966380000.0],"caja":[7724530000.0,8166900000.0,12258100000.0,11335900000.0],"patrimonio":[17222900000.0,18695300000.0,21267900000.0,22204300000.0]},"est_bpa":{"0y":{"m":4.04881,"b":4.00195,"a":4.17,"n":41.0,"c":0.7084,"ant":2.37},"+1y":{"m":5.21325,"b":4.2,"a":5.63,"n":42.0,"c":0.2876,"ant":4.04881}},"est_ing":{"0y":{"m":26074500000.0,"b":24718700000.0,"a":26834600000.0,"n":35.0,"c":0.0777,"ant":24193700000.0},"+1y":{"m":28987100000.0,"b":26270000000.0,"a":31066000000.0,"n":35.0,"c":0.1117,"ant":26074500000.0}},"recs":[{"p":"0m","sb":10.0,"b":29.0,"h":8.0,"s":0.0,"ss":0.0},{"p":"-1m","sb":10.0,"b":28.0,"h":9.0,"s":0.0,"ss":0.0},{"p":"-2m","sb":10.0,"b":28.0,"h":7.0,"s":0.0,"ss":0.0},{"p":"-3m","sb":10.0,"b":28.0,"h":7.0,"s":0.0,"ss":0.0}],"obj":{"current":76.46,"high":125.0,"low":75.0,"mean":98.1493,"median":100.0}}